    "title" : "13 Turuturu, Hawera - Niseko Real Estate Photographer ",
    "sourceUrl" : "",
    "body" : "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" data-updated-on=\"1730878343654\" id=\"item-672b095c3c8de53c16ffbe01\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-19bbcdfdadbacc179734\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>About us: </strong>PropertyMedia Japan specializes in Real Estate Photography, Videography, Aerial Photography, Floorplans and Virtual Staging. Previously based in Queenstown New Zealand, we are now operating in Niseko, Hokkaido Japan</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Bedrooms:</strong> 4 spacious bedrooms offer comfortable retreats for each family member.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Bathrooms:</strong> 2 well-designed bathrooms enhance convenience and functionality.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Living Spaces:</strong> Two separate living rooms provide flexible spaces for entertaining, relaxation, or family activities.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Garage:</strong> A single-car garage ensures secure parking and extra storage options.</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Located in the heart of Hawera, 13 Turuturu offers easy access to local schools, parks, and shops, ensuring convenience and lifestyle. This is an ideal home for families or anyone looking for a blend of charm and functionality. Don\u2019t miss the chance to view this fantastic property\u2014schedule a showing today and discover the potential that awaits!</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block gallery-block sqs-block-gallery\" data-block-json=\"&#123;&quot;existingGallery&quot;:null,&quot;hSize&quot;:null,&quot;newWindow&quot;:false,&quot;floatDir&quot;:null,&quot;methodOption&quot;:&quot;transient&quot;,&quot;aspectRatio&quot;:null,&quot;auto-crop&quot;:true,&quot;blockAnimation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;collectionId&quot;:&quot;672b17dfef4c15403e42e309&quot;,&quot;design&quot;:&quot;stacked&quot;,&quot;show-meta&quot;:true,&quot;show-meta-basic&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-title&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-description&quot;:false,&quot;square-thumbs&quot;:true,&quot;vSize&quot;:null,&quot;transientGalleryId&quot;:&quot;672b17dfef4c15403e42e309&quot;&#125;\" data-block-type=\"8\" data-sqsp-block=\"gallery\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1730782483469_254542\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n\n  \n\n  \n\n\n<div class=\"\n  sqs-gallery-container\n  sqs-gallery-block-stacked\n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n  \n\n  \n  block-animation-none\n  clear\"\n  \n  \n>\n  <div class=\"sqs-gallery\">\n    \n      \n        \n          <div class=\"image-wrapper\" id=\"672b17fdb91b177dc17c313b\" data-type=\"image\" data-animation-role=\"image\">\n            \n              <noscript><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/1730877443775-LWHXIZWPH0XF2ZWI1PIZ/13+Turutu+Niseko+Kutchan+Hokkaido+Japan+Real+Estate+Property+Agent+Photographer+Videographer+%2810%29.jpg\" alt=\"13 Turutu Niseko Kutchan Hokkaido Japan Real Estate Property Agent Photographer Videographer (10).jpg\" /></noscript><img class=\"thumb-image\" elementtiming=\"system-gallery-block-stacked\" data-src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/1730877443775-LWHXIZWPH0XF2ZWI1PIZ/13+Turutu+Niseko+Kutchan+Hokkaido+Japan+Real+Estate+Property+Agent+Photographer+Videographer+%2810%29.jpg\" data-image=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c72